-- id: exp6835-v598-terminal-evidence-freeze
-  title: V598 terminal evidence freeze and omission decomposition
-  track: verification
-  priority: critical
-  agent_type: codex
-  model: gpt-5.5
-  requires_gpu: false
-  max_turns: 30
-  estimated_wall_time_min: 90
-  per_unit_rows: true
-  milestone: 2026.09.598
-  deliverable: results/experiment_6835_v598_terminal_evidence_freeze.json
-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    V597 produced 900 complete local-SOTA rows. It also produced a null identifiability audit.
-    Only 395 of 18,900 target field cells were observed. This task freezes that evidence and
-    separates protocol failure, omission, contradiction, and joint semantic failure. It does not
-    repair output or reinterpret the Exp6834 null.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/research-program.md and {project_root}/_bmad/prd.md, FR12
-    - {project_root}/research-references.md, V598 Planner Refresh
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6831_v597_evidence_admissibility_contract.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6832_operational_obligation_saturation_fixture.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6833_sota_operational_obligation_saturation_corpus.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6834_operational_saturation_identifiability_audit.json
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/constraint-verification/spec.md
-    - {project_root}/scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py
-
-    TASK:
-    Build a fresh immutable evidence root for V598. Reparse every Exp6833 row without importing its
-    reducer. Classify each obligation cell and row. Preserve the Exp6834 null as the terminal finding
-    for generated-answer identifiability. Invoke no LLM.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require readable terminal Exp6831-Exp6834 artifacts, stable source hashes,
-       900 unique Exp6833 row identities, 150 unique fixture scenarios, and no owned-source drift.
-       Write complete_blocked_v598_terminal_evidence_freeze with gate_check_summary on failure.
-    1. Add REQ-CONSTRAINT-6835 and testable scenarios before implementation. Write tests for missing
-       rows, duplicate identities, hash drift, malformed output, omitted atoms, contradictions, and
-       preservation of null verdicts.
-    2. Write a fresh deterministic parser. Do not import the Exp6833 or Exp6834 reduction path.
-    3. Emit one row per model, prompt arm, scenario, and obligation atom. Label protocol failure,
-       omission, contradiction, atom pass, and joint pass separately.
-    4. Recompute observed-cell count, missing-cell count, collision witnesses, and compatible-policy
-       lower bound. Keep the source null if semantic preservation remains unidentified.
-    5. Set v598_evidence_root_ready_score to 1 only when the evidence is complete and immutable.
-       This readiness field is not a positive scientific result.
-    6. Run focused tests, ruff, OpenSpec coverage, adversarial verification, artifact convention
-       audit, verdict-row consistency lint, and root-clutter checks.
-    7. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles; preconditions_checked;
-       inference_substrate (deterministic CPU replay); duration_s; source_artifact_hashes;
-       reproducibility_checksum; rows (one source unit and obligation cell); failure_taxonomy;
-       observed_target_cells; missing_target_cells; collision_witnesses;
-       compatible_policy_lower_bound; source_null_preserved; obligation_failure_taxonomy_complete_score;
-       v598_evidence_root_ready_score (exact field consumed by Exp6836, Exp6839, and Exp6843);
-       gate_check_summary (failed check and observed value for any blocked verdict);
-       verifier_is_oracle (false); verdict_class (positive | circular_positive | null | blocked |
-       disqualified | partial); honest_verdict (terminal, row-supported, and prefixed complete_).
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6835_v598_terminal_evidence_freeze.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
-  prior_failures:
-    - experiment_id: exp6834-operational-saturation-identifiability-audit
-      verdict: complete_null_operational_field_preservation_not_identified
-      addressed_by: 'This task does not rerun the unidentified policy estimate. It freezes raw rows and decomposes missing evidence into protocol, omission, contradiction, atom, and joint categories before changing the measurement surface.'
-      retire_if_same_verdict: true
