-  gated_on:
-    - upstream: exp6835-v598-terminal-evidence-freeze
-      artifact_field: v598_evidence_root_ready_score
-      op: '=='
-      value: 1
-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    Exp6835 preserves the V597 null and requires a new measurement surface. SUN Programs
-    (arXiv:2608.31167) suggests one typed executable that compiles into a cost, predicate, reward,
-    guard, and diagnostic. Carnot already has exact prerequisite, authority, fallback, consequence,
-    and priority atoms. This task compiles them and creates fixed candidate pairs. It invokes no LLM.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/research-program.md and {project_root}/_bmad/prd.md, FR11 and FR12
-    - {project_root}/research-references.md, V598 Planner Refresh
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6811_operational_obligation_automaton_v3.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6832_operational_obligation_saturation_fixture.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6835_v598_terminal_evidence_freeze.json
-    - {project_root}/python/carnot/constraint_obligation_automaton.py
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/constraint-verification/spec.md
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/continuous-learning/spec.md
-
-    TASK:
-    Implement a typed obligation program. Compile each immutable atom ledger into an exact scalar
-    energy, satisfaction predicate, memory admission guard, ARC shadow action guard, and per-atom
-    diagnostic. Freeze matched fixed-sequence candidate pairs for later local-model scoring.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require v598_evidence_root_ready_score=1, the Exp6811 schema, the Exp6832
-       fixture, stable hashes, and no generated answer in the new candidate fixture. Write
-       complete_blocked_typed_obligation_program_fixture with gate_check_summary on failure.
-    1. Add REQ-CONSTRAINT-6836 and REQ-CL-6836 with testable scenarios before implementation.
-       Write tests for compile parity, atom omission, contradiction, impossible sets, guard fail-close,
-       diagnostics, serialization, permutation invariance, and stable hashes.
-    2. Implement one typed program interface. Its five compiled views must share atom identities and
-       exact semantics. Do not maintain five independent hand-written policies.
-    3. Freeze compatible and one-atom-violating candidate sequences. Require equal candidate token
-       counts within each evaluated tokenizer. Include joint violations and impossible cases.
-    4. Add candidate identifier, row order, label swap, token length, prompt length, and surface-form
-       controls. Store raw text and expected tokenization inputs. Store no model scores.
-    5. Validate the exact checker on every candidate. Set typed_obligation_program_ready_score and
-       obligation_pair_fixture_ready_score from compile parity and fixture integrity only.
-    6. Run focused tests, ruff, OpenSpec coverage, adversarial verification, artifact convention
-       audit, fixture mutation checks, verdict-row consistency lint, and root-clutter checks.
-    7. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles; preconditions_checked;
-       inference_substrate (deterministic CPU compilation); duration_s; source_artifact_hashes;
-       random_seed; reproducibility_checksum; typed_program_schema; compiled_view_manifest;
-       atom_identity_manifest; compile_parity_results; rows (one candidate pair and control);
-       candidate_pair_manifest; exact_candidate_labels; shortcut_control_manifest;
-       checker_mutation_results; typed_obligation_program_ready_score (exact field consumed by
-       Exp6837 and Exp6846); obligation_pair_fixture_ready_score (exact field consumed by Exp6837);
-       gate_check_summary (failed check and observed value for any blocked verdict);
-       verifier_is_oracle (false, exact checkers supply external truth); verdict_class (positive |
-       circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial); honest_verdict (terminal and
-       prefixed complete_).
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6836_typed_obligation_program_fixture.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
-  prior_failures:
-    - experiment_id: exp6802-operational-obligation-automaton-v2
-      verdict: complete_blocked_operational_obligation_automaton
-      addressed_by: 'Exp6802 lacked its owned agentic-verification capability spec. Exp6810 and Exp6811 shipped that contract. This task uses the existing spec and compiles one shared typed object instead of retrying the blocked v2 fixture.'
-      retire_if_same_verdict: true
