-    CONTEXT:
-    Generated-answer transport is not identifiable in V597. Exp6836 supplies exact fixed candidate
-    pairs and a typed obligation program. This task measures conditional sequence-score margins. It
-    does not generate answers. It is not an HSRM reproduction because the current local runner does
-    not expose step-boundary hidden states.
